## 8. Static Analysis & Compliance
- PHP:
  - `strict_types=1` required
  - No Composer - using plain PHP includes
  - Follow PSR-4 autoloading standards
- TypeScript:
  - Strict mode enabled
  - No `any` types without justification
  - ESLint with TypeScript plugin
- Database:
  - All queries must use prepared statements
  - Index all foreign keys
  - Regular EXPLAIN analysis for slow queries
- IFC Specific:
  - Validate IFC models before processing
  - Handle malformed IFC files gracefully

